Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "ratio-basics", "key_answer": "13 : 45"}, {"n": 22, "text": "The sum of five numbers is 655. The average of the first two numbers is 75 and the third number is 116. Find the average of the remaining two numbers?", "options": [{"text": "192", "added": false}, {"text": "194.5", "added": false}, {"text": "191", "added": false}, {"text": "195.5", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "series-average", "key_answer": "194.5"}, {"n": 23, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "−31", "added": false}, {"text": "−29", "added": false}, {"text": "−25", "added": false}, {"text": "−27", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Algebra", "sub": "linear-equations", "key_answer": "−29"}, {"n": 24, "text": "After 62 litres of petrol was poured into an empty storage tank, it was still 10% empty. How much petrol (in litres, rounded off to two decimal place) must be poured into the storage tank in order to fill it?", "options": [{"text": "69.89", "added": false}, {"text": "63", "added": false}, {"text": "68.89", "added": false}, {"text": "67.89", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Pipes-Cisterns", "sub": "fill-empty", "key_answer": "68.89"}, {"n": 25, "text": "The sum of five numbers is 655. The average of the first two numbers is 76 and the third number is 102. Find the average of the remaining two numbers?", "options": [{"text": "178", "added": false}, {"text": "200.5", "added": false}, {"text": "201.5", "added": false}, {"text": "179", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "series-average", "key_answer": "200.5"}, {"n": 26, "text": "If the distance between A and B is 1404 Km. From A, Namit goes to B with speed 69 km/h and return to A with the speed 49 km/h. Find the average speed of Namit.(rounded off to two decimal place)", "options": [{"text": "60.78 km/h", "added": false}, {"text": "