 of a triangle is doubled, then its area is _______ times the previous area.", "options": [{"text": "2", "added": false}, {"text": "1.5", "added": false}, {"text": "2.5", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "triangle-and-quadrilaterals", "key_answer": "4"}, {"n": 32, "text": "Simplify the following: 12 ÷ (12 × 12) + (15 ÷15) ÷ 15 × 15 + 15", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 33, "text": "Which of the following numbers is divisible by 5?", "options": [{"text": "24314", "added": false}, {"text": "24311", "added": false}, {"text": "24317", "added": false}, {"text": "24315", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "divisibility-rules", "key_answer": "24315"}, {"n": 34, "text": "In covering a distance of 40 km, Amit takes 2 hours more than Vinay. If Amit doubles his speed, then he would take 8 hour less than Vinay. Amit's speed is:", "options": [{"text": "2 km/h", "added": false}, {"text": "4 km/h", "added": false}, {"text": "12 km/h", "added": false}, {"text": "11 km/h Section : General Intelligence and Reasoning", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": "2 km/h"}]}